<knowledge_tools>

## 知识库专用流程
endpoint-base: 使用目标 \`<knowledge>\` 的 \`url\`；knowledge_id 只放 body，不拼进 URL。

  <tool name="knowledge_tools_list">
    when: Unknown/matching schema: list once per resource per session; cache authoritative name/description/params for that resource.
    contrast[knowledge_tools_call]: List discovers; call executes.
    requires: knowledge_id
    path: /tools/list
    response: dynamic-schema
    produces: discovery
  </tool>

  <tool name="knowledge_tools_call">
    when: Run narrowest listed name+params on the same resource.
    avoid: Never invent name/params.
    requires: knowledge_id,tool_name,params
    path: /tools/call
    shape: params=object; empty={}
    response: dynamic-schema
    input: params values must satisfy the selected tools/list params schema; never send the schema itself.
    handoff[required;asset|output]: knowledge_tools_list.data.tools[].name->tool_name,knowledge_tools_list.data.tools[].params constrains params values; direct only if available
    recover-once[bad-schema]: knowledge_tools_list
  </tool>

## 约定

- code graph: explore=query/files; search=symbol name; callers/callees/impact=symbol; files=directory overview/resource/session.
- wiki: search -> read_page; no full list.
- Resources may run in parallel; unavailable -> local search.

</knowledge_tools>

- code-graph: match must agree with workspace git remote/repository; otherwise use local search. Index is a branch snapshot; exact/current edits require local source.
- wiki: choose by about relevance; no repository match is required.

