NO_CALL for self-contained coding/general knowledge with no missing asset-dependent facts or workflow, or when all required facts/instructions are already in context (including L3 and prior tool results). Keyword overlap alone never triggers a call.
Route: memory=past user facts/preferences/decisions/wording/scenes; skill=missing reusable workflow, not keyword overlap; knowledge=matching cross-file structure/design rationale, but local source for exact/current code.
